   "text": "{\"sections\":[{\"section\":\"summary\",\"body\":\"Dataflake Inc breached its Minimum Unrestricted Cash covenant for the period ended October 31, 2026, on the bank's calculation of {{fact:72314421-976e-4db8-8c1a-54edfb96cefd}} against a required {{fact:90263cfa-801d-4997-8049-daccf4de5980}}. The compliance certificate reports {{fact:20e82f95-f192-4d3b-ad4b-4c408e3fa3fc}} and claims compliance. The certificate also reports a higher runway than the bank calculates. Revenue is ahead of plan, but cash and runway cushions have been narrowing. The certificate mismatch on the cash covenant has already been escalated to committee, which holds the decision.\"},{\"section\":\"covenants\",\"body\":\"Minimum Unrestricted Cash is in breach. Calculated cash of {{fact:72314421-976e-4db8-8c1a-54edfb96cefd}} is below the {{fact:90263cfa-801d-4997-8049-daccf4de5980}} minimum, a cushion of {{fact:420db624-0e32-49de-bd64-e9d3d4a80144}}. The certificate reports {{fact:20e82f95-f192-4d3b-ad4b-4c408e3fa3fc}} and claims compliance. Minimum Runway is compliant at {{fact:487a261a-74e2-4da2-b28a-9a21c7314a68}} against a required {{fact:4ade100d-b734-4ee7-b218-8cfac3d30ff0}}, a cushion of {{fact:fd556cd6-994a-4d89-9e88-46a9b164bf2d}}. The certificate reports a higher {{fact:ec483d01-4115-4f8c-9b47-fd69f2f8a2c1}}. Revenue to Plan is compliant at {{fact:8355c16b-7307-4ae8-bd20-7863e9f14f59}} against {{fact:d02964b1-6a21-403e-9f43-f5e3847f88d6}}, a cushion of {{fact:b2ad5621-2c45-45fc-8dba-38d4a4817d2b}}, and agrees with the certificate.\"},{\"section\":\"risks\",\"body\":\"The highest-severity signal is runway below the watch level. That work item has been acknowledged. The covenant headroom signal flags the negative cash cushion of {{fact:420db624-0e32-49de-bd64-e9d3d4a80144}}, the balance-sheet counterpart to the short runway. Two lower-severity signals show cash and runway headroom both declining from August through October. This points to a sustained cash drain rather than a single-month dip. The critical work item, a cash covenant failure reported as compliant, has been escalated to committee. The certificate also overstates runway against the bank's calculation, and a reviewer may wish to reconcile how the borrower derived both certificate figures. No work items remain open.\"}]}",
   "type": "text"
  }
